          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}V&=\\frac13\\pi r^2h\\\\10\\,603&=\\frac13\\pi x^2\\times45\\\\10\\,603&=15\\pi x^2\\\\x^2&=\\frac{10\\,603}{15\\pi}\\\\x&=\\sqrt{\\frac{10\\,603}{15\\pi}}\\\\x&\\approx15.0\\text{ mm}\\end{align*}$$",
